  "verdictBasis": {
    "acceptedParts": "Candidate JSON no longer carries store/index authority; live host-port admission, exact identities/substitutions, RT12/V7 direction, live six-write atomicity controls, OP2 projection, D9 failure mapping and blocked product state are coherent.",
    "decisiveFailure": "The claimed durable stored resolver depends on an in-memory candidate cache. After process loss, CAS/index alone cannot exercise the packet's resolver, so Evidence v6 cannot reconstruct the same authority/custody chain required by its journal recovery and OP5 inherits an incomplete mechanism.",
    "whyRequiredChangesNotFail": "This is a candidate-only packet with no applied authority, and the defect has a bounded architectural repair: persist or deterministically reconstruct the closed authority input, remint capabilities under a reopened port, and prove recovery from cold durable state.",
    "final": "REQUIRED-CHANGES"
  }
}
